'''Swordsman''' (剣士 ''Kenshi'', '''Swordsman''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] [[:Category:Collaboration Event Enemies|Collaboration Event]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Swordsman
|image = E 025.png
|first appearance = [[High Heels and Chamomile]]
|latest appearance = [[There's Always Room for Sweets]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3,160¢
}}

==Enemy==
Swordsman has slow movement speed and a slow attack rate. This form has surprisingly high attack power, reaching a maximum of '''50,000''' on [[Way of Princess Punt (Insane)]], but this all depends on the strength magnification of him in the stage you are playing, and even then it won't matter too much due to his very low health and range.

==Strategy==
Even with his increased attack power, his health and range render him extremely easy to defeat.

